<title>SOUTH KOREA: DAEWOO TELECOM H1 NET FALLS SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>DAEWOO TELECOM H1 NET FALLS SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     187 vs 189</p>
<p>    Net					    5.02 vs 5.08</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  6.54 vs 6.42</p>
<p>    Turnover				   452.76 vs 360.86</p>
<p>Note - Daewoo Telecom Co Ltd, a unit of the Daewoo Group, said net profits fell despite a rise in sales because of interest costs after loan defaults by Hanbo Steel in January.</p>
</text>
